Shift [SimTalk] - Worker
Sets the name of the Shift during which the Worker designated by <Path> works.
Remarks
Specify an empty string "" to make the Worker work during all shifts which are defined in the associated
ShiftCalendar.
Syntax
<Path>.Shift:string
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type string.
Example
